    744  060a							; Schedule (VBLANK): the event queue for the enemies SelectEnemies took, one
    745  060a							; 8-byte record per enemy in row order. Each enemy's graphics are padded with
    746  060a							; only 40 zeros, so its pointer must be replaced within 40 rows of it: an
    747  060a							; event row comes at most 41 rows after the previous enemy's feet, and after
    748  060a							; the last enemy a park record points player 1 at zeros.
