   1027  2775							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
   1028  2775							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
   1029  2775							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
   1030  2775							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
   1031  2775							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
   1032  2775							; one bite. A jack-in-the-box springs on whatever reaches it; reaching the
   1033  2775							; toy box is a breach.
