   1503  2aa3							; Splash (odd frames): a cannonball's burst also hits every other monster on
   1504  2aa3							; its shelf within SPLASH pixels of the one it hit; a jet's burst (bit 7 of
   1505  2aa3							; splashN; no monster hit first) hits every monster on its shelf. One monster
   1506  2aa3							; is checked a frame (five frames a burst), which keeps the frame time bounded
