   1713  2c02							;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1714  2c02							; Sound: channel 0 plays the player's actions and jingles, channel 1 combat.
   1715  2c02							; A sound is a list of steps (ticks of two frames, AUDC*16+AUDV, AUDF) ending
   1716  2c02							; in a zero; a new sound replaces the one playing on its channel unless that
   1717  2c02							; one matters more (SndPri).
   1718  2c02				   SndPlay		; A = sound id; keeps X and Y
   1719  2c02					      SUBROUTINE
